    "description": {
      "value": "<p>这张卡片储存了一道6环法术（由DM选择）。以一个动作，你可以挥舞这张卡片并用其施放存储的法术（法术攻击加值+9，豁免DC 17）。这一特性一经使用，直到次日黎明之前无法再次使用。</p><p>This card holds one 6th-level spell (chosen by the DM). As an action, you can brandish this card and use it to cast the spell stored inside (spell attack bonus +9, save DC 17). Once this property is used, it can't be used again until the next dawn.</p>",
